{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>迪士尼郵輪（Disney Cruise Line）宣佈，日本首艘迪士尼郵輪正式命名為「Disney Imagination」！新船由營運東京迪士尼樂園的 Oriental Land（OLC）集團營運，預計於 2029 年春季正式以東京為母港啟航！船身設計最大亮點莫過於船尾特別打造的《小魚仙》Ariel與Sebastian造型，小魚仙迷絕對要鎖定打卡！船上活動非常豐富，包括設有超過 1,300 座位的劇院上演獨家原創舞台劇、戶外甲板角色秀及豐富互動節目；餐飲方面更配備 3 間主題餐廳以及約 30 間餐飲咖啡與酒吧。加上郵輪限定精品店、兒童專屬區及成人寧靜區，一家大小都可以享受，好期待啊！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179204402277153389_6237874726ad06bf705ec8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179204402477766777_12226544236ad06bf93afd9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179204402703967400_4592124466ad06bfb387e1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:34.742320+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":361,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:55.531341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:55.633083+00:00","content_hash":"e549320f4917f3dd52323d812ab14de609fc026144bfee8724bce6d692f8e67f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}